	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Test a website on multiple mobile device sizes via the `mobile` keyword.

![Keyword to launch a UI](images/about/keyword.png)

![UI showing a mobile website](images/about/ui.png)

* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;P&lt;/kbd&gt; Focus device picker.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↑&lt;/kbd&gt; Select previous device.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↓&lt;/kbd&gt; Select next device.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;L&lt;/kbd&gt; Focus URL field.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌘&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; Reload URL in field.

Alternatively, open a URL to test via the [Universal Action](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/features/universal-actions/).

![Universal Action to launch a test](images/about/ua.png)

Edit the list of devices or configure the window to open separately in the [Workflow’s Configuration](https://www.alfredapp.com/help/workflows/user-configuration/).</string>
